  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "A bomb brings down an airliner meant for China's Premier. Nehru sends one Indian police officer to find who did it."
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirteen years later, that officer builds India's foreign intelligence service from scratch."
    },
    {
      "text": "He warns that Pakistan's dictator may start a war. Thirteen days of fighting later, Bangladesh is born."
    },
    {
      "text": "And almost no photograph of him exists."
    },
    {
      "text": "RAW Files, Episode One. Now on The Sisodia Files."
    }
  ],
